get_my_strategies: description  -limit keeps +Archived strategies count toward limit, and there is no paging: a strategy beyond -N (default 20, at most 50); +limit is read by its id with get_strategy; -key; +key (without one the call is refused with 401) and spends 1 read unit of the daily quota;
